          "hasta": 2
        },
        {
          "en": 2.1,
          "texto": {
            "es": "SU PLACER ES AMARGO",
            "en": "THEIR PLEASURE IS BITTER"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 180
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "The rulers had put Adam in their paradise, among the trees they had planted.",
          "es": "Los gobernantes habían puesto a Adán en su paraíso, entre los árboles que habían plantado."
        },
        {
          "en": "They said to him, \"Eat,\" as if to say, \"Enjoy yourself.\"",
          "es": "Le dijeron: \"Come\", como diciendo: \"Disfruta\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "But their pleasure is bitter, and their beauty is corrupt.",
          "es": "Pero su placer es amargo, y su belleza está corrompida."
        },
        {
          "en": "Their pleasure is a trap, and their trees are wickedness.",
          "es": "Su placer es una trampa, y sus árboles son maldad."
        },
        {
          "en": "Their fruit is a deadly poison, and their promise is death.",
          "es": "Su fruta es un veneno mortal, y su promesa es la muerte."
        }
      ]
    },
