        {
          "en": 0.3,
          "texto": {
            "es": "EL ÁRBOL DEL CONOCIMIENTO DEL BIEN Y DEL MAL",
            "en": "THE TREE OF KNOWLEDGE OF GOOD AND EVIL"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 170,
          "hasta": 2
        },
        {
          "en": 3.1,
          "texto": {
            "es": "QUE NO MIRE HACIA ARRIBA",
            "en": "SO HE WOULD NOT LOOK UP"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 170
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "There was the tree they call the tree of knowledge of good and evil.",
          "es": "Estaba el árbol que llaman el árbol del conocimiento del bien y del mal."
        },
        {
          "en": "That tree is the Epinoia of light, the bright thought from above.",
          "es": "Ese árbol es la Epinoia de luz, el pensamiento luminoso de lo alto."
        },
        {
          "en": "The rulers stood in front of it, to keep Adam away.",
          "es": "Los gobernantes se pararon delante de él, para mantener lejos a Adán."
        },
        {
          "en": "They did not want him to look up to his fullness.",
          "es": "No querían que mirara hacia arriba, hacia su plenitud."
        },
        {
          "en": "And they did not want him to see the nakedness of his shame.",
          "es": "Y no querían que viera la desnudez de su vergüenza."
        }
      ]
    },
