            "en": "THE EAGLE OF LIGHT"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 170
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "But the Savior said, \"It was I who brought it about that they ate.\"",
          "es": "Pero el Salvador dijo: \"Fui yo quien hizo que comieran\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "The Savior also told John that he came to that tree in the form of an eagle.",
          "es": "El Salvador también le contó a Juan que vino a ese árbol en forma de águila."
        },
        {
          "en": "He came on the tree of knowledge, which is the Epinoia from the pure light.",
          "es": "Vino sobre el árbol del conocimiento, que es la Epinoia de la luz pura."
        },
        {
          "en": "He came to teach them, and to wake them from the depth of sleep.",
          "es": "Vino a enseñarles, y a despertarlos de lo profundo del sueño."
        }
      ]
